          \"name\": \"Atlas Aircon\"\r\n          },\r\n          \"areaServed\": {\r\n            \"@type\": \"City\",\r\n            \"name\": \"Vadodara\"\r\n          },\r\n          \"description\": \"Professional installation for all types of ACs including Split, Window, and Central units.\",\r\n          \"offers\": {\r\n             \"@type\": \"Offer\",\r\n             \"price\": \"1499\",\r\n             \"priceCurrency\": \"INR\"\r\n          }\r\n        },\r\n         {\r\n          \"@type\": \"Service\",\r\n          \"serviceType\": \"AC Repair Service\",\r\n          \"provider\": {\r\n            \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\",\r\n            \"name\": \"Atlas Aircon\"\r\n          },\r\n          \"areaServed\": {\r\n            \"@type\": \"City\",\r\n            \"name\": \"Vadodara\"\r\n          },\r\n          \"description\": \"Fast and reliable AC repair for all major brands. We fix cooling issues, gas leaks, PCB problems and more.\",\r\n          \"offers\": {\r\n             \"@type\": \"Offer\",\r\n             \"price\": \"499\",\r\n             \"priceCurrency\": \"INR\"\r\n          }\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n          \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\r\n          \"mainEntity\": [\r\n             {\r\n                \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n                \"name\": \"What are the charges for AC installation in Vadodara?\",\r\n                \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n                   \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n                   \"text\": \"The AC installation charges in Vadodara vary depending on the type of AC. For a Split AC installation, the cost is typically around ₹1499, and for a Window AC installation, it's around ₹699. Additional charges may apply for extra copper piping or other materials.\"\r\n                }\r\n             },\r\n             {\r\n                \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n                \"name\": \"Do you provide same-day AC installation service?\",\r\n                \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        