xt-xl font-bold mb-2\">Certified Technicians</h3>\r\n<p>Our team consists of skilled and experienced professionals for all AC brands.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-lg shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition\">\r\n<div class=\"text-4xl golden-text mb-4\"> </div>\r\n<h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2\">3-Month Guarantee</h3>\r\n<p>We provide a <strong>3-month guarantee</strong> on all our services and parts for your peace of mind.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-lg shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition\">\r\n<div class=\"text-4xl golden-text mb-4\"> </div>\r\n<h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2\">Transparent Pricing</h3>\r\n<p>No hidden costs. Get clear <strong>AC installation charges in Vadodara</strong> before we start.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-lg shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition\">\r\n<div class=\"text-4xl golden-text mb-4\"> </div>\r\n<h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2\">24/7 Support</h3>\r\n<p>Facing an issue post-installation? We offer prompt support whenever you need it.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<!-- Our Services Section -->\r\n<section class=\"py-16\">\r\n<div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\">\r\n<h2 class=\"section-title\">Our Premier <span class=\"golden-text\">AC Services</span></h2>\r\n<div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mt-16\"><!-- Service Card 1: Split AC Installation -->\r\n<div class=\"service-card\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover alignnone\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Split-Ac-Installation-and-Repair-Service-1.webp\" alt=\"Professional Standard AC Installation Service\" width=\"1072\" height=\"1080\" title=\"\">\r\n<div class=\"p-6\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-2\"><strong>Split AC Installation</strong> Vadodara</h3>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4\">Professional <strong>Split AC installation</strong> for all brands like Daikin, Voltas, Lloyd. Perfect fitting for maximum cooling.</p>\r\n<div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\"><span class=\"price-tag px-4 py-2 rounded-md\">Starts at ₹1499</span> <a class=\"font-bold golden-text hover:underline\" href=\"#contact\">Book Now →</a></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- Service Card 2: Window AC Installation -->\r\n<div class=\"service-card\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/AC-Installation-in-Vadodara-Guide.jpg\" alt=\"Window AC Installation Vadodara\" title=\"\">\r\n<div class=\"p-6\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-2\"><strong>Window AC Installation</strong> Vadodara</h3>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4\">Quick and secure <strong>Window AC installation price</strong> that fits your budget. We ensure a perfect seal and stable setup.</p>\r\n<div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\"><span class=\"price-tag px-4 py-2 rounded-md\">Starts at ₹699</span> <a class=\"font-bold golden-text hover:underline\" href=\"#contact\">Book Now →</a></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- Service Card 3: AC Uninstallation -->\r\n<div class=\"service-card\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Untitled-design-2.webp\" alt=\"AC Uninstallation Service Vadodara\" title=\"\">\r\n<div class=\"p-6\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-2\"><strong>AC Uninstallation &amp; Shifting</strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4\">Safe <strong>AC removing service Vadodara</strong> and <strong>AC shifting service in Vadodara</strong>. We handle your unit with care.</p>\r\n<div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\"><span class=\"price-tag px-4 py-2 rounded-md\">Starts at ₹499</span> <a class=\"font-bold golden-text hover:underline\" href=\"#contact\">Book Now →</a></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- Service Card 4: AC Repair Service -->\r\n<div class=\"service-card\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/spring-vibes-shine-through-with-stylish-young-woma-2025-04-11-01-09-04-utc-1.webp\" alt=\"AC Repair Vadodara\" title=\"\">\r\n<div class=\"p-6\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-2\"><strong>AC Repair</strong> Service Vadodara</h3>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4\">From minor fixes to major repairs, our team provides the <strong>best ac repair service in Vadodara</strong>.</p>\r\n<div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\"><span class=\"price-tag px-4 py-2 rounded-md\">Inspection at ₹299</span> <a class=\"font-bold golden-text hover:underline\" href=\"#contact\">Book a Technician →</a></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- Service Card 5: AC Gas Filling -->\r\n<div class=\"service-card\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/modern-digital-thermostat-perhaps-showing-an-error-message-or-incorrect-temperature.webp\" alt=\"AC Gas Filling Vadodara\" title=\"\">\r\n<div class=\"p-6\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-2\"><strong>AC Gas Filling</strong> Vadodara</h3>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4\">Low cooling? It might be the gas. Get quick and reliable AC gas filling service for all models.</p>\r\n<div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\"><span class=\"price-tag px-4 py-2 rounded-md\">Starts at ₹2499</span> <a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"font-bold golden-text hover:underline\" href=\"https://atlasaircons.com/ac-gas-refilling/\">Learn More →</a></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- Service Card 6: Deep Cleaning Service -->\r\n<div class=\"service-card\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/deep-cleaning-ac-service.webp\" alt=\"Deep Cleaning AC Service Vadodara\" title=\"\">\r\n<div class=\"p-6\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-2\"><strong>Deep Cleaning</strong> AC Service</h3>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4\">Improve cooling efficiency and air quality with our intensive deep cleaning AC service.</p>\r\n<div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\"><span class=\"price-tag px-4 py-2 rounded-md\">Starts at ₹999</span> <a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"font-bold golden-text hover:underline\" href=\"https://atlasaircons.com/services/\">Explore Services →</a></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<!-- Price List Section -->\r\n<section id=\"prices\" class=\"py-16 bg-white\">\r\n<div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\">\r\n<h2 class=\"section-title\">Transparent <span class=\"golden-text\">Service Pricing</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"text-center text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12\">We believe in honesty. Below is a detailed breakdown of our AC installation and uninstallation charges in Vadodara. No surprises, just great service.</p>\r\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\r\n<table class=\"w-full max-w-4xl mx-auto text-left shadow-lg rounded-lg\">\r\n<thead class=\"bg-gray-800 text-white\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<th class=\"p-4 rounded-tl-lg\">Service</th>\r\n<th class=\"p-4\">AC Type</th>\r\n<th class=\"p-4 rounded-tr-lg\">Price</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b bg-gray-50\">\r\n<td class=\"p-4 font-bold\"><strong>Split AC Installation</strong></td>\r\n<td class=\"p-4\">1 to 2.5 Ton</td>\r\n<td class=\"p-4 font-bold golden-text\">₹1,499</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b bg-white\">\r\n<td class=\"p-4 font-bold\"><strong>Window AC Installation</strong></td>\r\n<td class=\"p-4\">1 to 2.5 Ton</td>\r\n<td class=\"p-4 font-bold golden-text\">₹699</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b bg-gray-50\">\r\n<td class=\"p-4 font-bold\"><strong>AC Uninstallation</strong> / Dismantle</td>\r\n<td class=\"p-4\">Split AC</td>\r\n<td class=\"p-4 font-bold golden-text\">₹499</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b bg-white\">\r\n<td class=\"p-4 font-bold\"><strong>AC Uninstallation</strong> / Dismantle</td>\r\n<td class=\"p-4\">Window AC</td>\r\n<td class=\"p-4 font-bold golden-text\">₹399</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"border-b bg-gray-50\">\r\n<td class=\"p-4 font-bold\"><strong>AC Shifting</strong> (Uninstall + Install)</td>\r\n<td class=\"p-4\">Split AC</td>\r\n<td class=\"p-4 font-bold golden-text\">₹1,899</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"bg-white\">\r\n<td class=\"p-4 font-bold\">Extra Copper Pipe (per meter)</td>\r\n<td class=\"p-4\">All Types</td>\r\n<td class=\"p-4 font-bold golden-text\">As per market rate</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"text-center text-sm text-gray-500 mt-4\">*Prices are indicative and may vary based on complexity. Final price will be quoted after inspection. GST extra as applicable.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<!-- Service Areas Section -->\r\n<section class=\"py-16\">\r\n<div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\">\r\n<h2 class=\"section-title\">Serving All of <span class=\"golden-text\">Vadodara &amp; Gujarat</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"text-center text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12\">Looking for <strong>AC installation near me in Vadodara</strong>? We&#8217;ve got you covered. Our network extends across Vadodara and major industrial hubs in Gujarat.</p>\r\n<h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-center mb-6\">Key Service Areas in Vadodara</h3>\r\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-4 text-center\">\r\n<div class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded-md shadow-sm\">Ajwa Road</div>\r\n<div class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded-md shadow-sm\">Akota</div>\r\n<div class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded-md shadow-sm\">Alkapuri</div>\r\n<div class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded-md shadow-sm\">Bhayli</div>\r\n<div class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded-md shadow-sm\">Chhani</div>\r\n<div class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded-md shadow-sm\">Gotri</div>\r\n<div class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded-md shadow-sm\">Harni</div>\r\n<div class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded-md shadow-sm\">Karelibaug</div>\r\n<div class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded-md shadow-sm\">Makar