>\r\n<p>Yes, we are experts in installing all major AC brands, including <strong>Voltas split AC installation in Vadodara</strong>, <strong>Daikin AC installation</strong>, Lloyd, Samsung, LG, Hitachi, and more. Our technicians are trained to handle the specific requirements of each brand.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"faq-item\">\r\n<div class=\"faq-question\">What are the <strong>AC removal costs in Vadodara</strong>? <i class=\"fas fa-chevron-down faq-toggle\"></i></div>\r\n<div class=\"faq-answer\">\r\n<p>Our <strong>AC dismantle service in Vadodara</strong> is very affordable. The charges for un-installing a split AC are ₹499, and for a window AC, it&#8217;s ₹399. We also offer <strong>AC uninstall and reinstall</strong> combo packages if you are relocating your unit within Vadodara.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"faq-item\">\r\n<div class=\"faq-question\">Can you <strong>relocate an AC unit in Vadodara</strong>? <i class=\"fas fa-chevron-down faq-toggle\"></i></div>\r\n<div class=\"faq-answer\">\r\n<p>Absolutely! Our <strong>AC shifting service in Vadodara</strong> is a complete package. It includes professional uninstallation from your current location and re-installation at the new location, ensuring your AC is set up perfectly for optimal performance.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"faq-item\">\r\n<div class=\"faq-question\">How quickly can I get my AC installed?<i class=\"fas fa-chevron-down faq-toggle\"></i></div>\r\n<div class=\"faq-answer\">\r\n<p>We pride ourselves on providing prompt service. We offer <strong>same-day AC installation in Vadodara</strong> for most cases. To ensure a quick turnaround, we recommend booking your service slot in the morning.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<!-- Contact / CTA Section -->\r\n<section id=\"contact\" class=\"py-20 bg-gray-800 text-white\">\r\n<div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-4xl font-extrabold mb-4\">R